title: Sensitive Privileges Assigned at Logon
id: 8d420733-1a8a-43a0-b173-b75b16534eb3
status: experimental
description: Detects assignment of sensitive privileges at logon (event 4672 with SeDebugPrivilege/SeTcbPrivilege/SeBackupPrivilege) to accounts that are not expected administrators, indicating privileged access.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 4672
    PrivilegeList|contains:
      - 'SeDebugPrivilege'
      - 'SeTcbPrivilege'
      - 'SeBackupPrivilege'
      - 'SeLoadDriverPrivilege'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - TargetUserName
  - IpAddress
falsepositives:
  - Administrator and service logons
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.privilege_escalation
  - attack.t1078
